WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.208 --> 00:00:12.792
Satisfaction with the trial run service is overwhelming, practically off the charts.

2
00:00:13.128 --> 00:00:24.600
Sitting in front of the mirror with the artist and working out the part direction, volume height, and bun position together to settle on your best style

3
00:00:24.936 --> 00:00:30.360
is a meaningful experience that turns vague anxiety into confidence and excitement.

4
00:00:30.696 --> 00:00:40.296
Mothers who lost sleep worrying, "Will an updo make me look older," often say, "Now I feel at ease," after the trial and are delighted with it.

5
00:00:40.632 --> 00:00:49.272
This reassurance service gets you past all that worrying by showing you exactly how you'll look, which is why satisfaction runs so high.

6
00:00:49.608 --> 00:00:56.856
It's a chance to get all your questions answered, about your face, your hair, your hanbok, and anything else.
